es though above everyone  else  because if he doesn't i mean miriam is  just going to be on the war path he is  not going to stop  until shigaraki is dead till maki is  dead he would even fight them quirkless  i bet  another interesting thing to note is  tokyomi using dark shadow to keep a  bunch of medics safe from all the  falling rocks caused by makia  way back in chapter 273 which is 10  chapters ago now  fat gum saw tokyomi and hawks and told  them where the medics were  so that explains why they're at this  medical site if you look at the doctors  themselves i mean they're pretty much  identical either that or they all have  to be bald for some reason but  my assumption is that there is just one  medic and he has a quirk that lets him  split himself into many copies  possibly that or horukoshi just couldn't  be bothered to draw different looking  medics  i mean either way it works before we  move on to the next thing  i need to point out that mushroom girl  from class 1b  i mean she asks a very relevant question  which is shouldn't the sedative have  kicked in by now  previously we never had a concrete  timeline as to  how long the drug would take right so we  knew that it was implied that he'd fall  asleep pretty quickly  and then obviously momo said it would  kick in the faster machine moves around  well now we have confirmation from  mushroom girl just straight up  it should have worked by now it should  have kicked in um so that is our  confirmation right there  couple that with the fact that now  machia he's stronger than ever and he's  got this you know  his arms his hands are transforming into  these giant claws  he's never been more scary than he is  right now so make of that what you will  you know the drug should have kicked in  maybe it has maybe it has  but it's just not the drug we think i  know many people do not want to believe  momo is the traitor  and you know what i don't want to  believe it either i don't think she has  to be  but until this drug has the intended  effect that it was supposed to have  or that we were told it was supposed to  have you know i can't just drop it you  know it's possible  she is the traitor anyway perhaps one of  the most interesting details of this  chapter  was the different expressions we see  from the league of villain members  as machia tears through a city killing  thousands of innocent people in the  process  we get a look at spinner's face and that  face to me is someone who's really  considering if they're doing the right  thing  um we saw back in the overhaul arc that  spinner  back then he questioned whether the  villains are following stains ideals  and this is another one of those moments  would stain really want giganto machia  you know killing all these people and  destroying cities in the process  would stain want that i don't think so  that makes it all the more hilarious to  compare spinner's face  to darby's face because if you guys  remember darby is also a loyal  follower of stain and when you look at  his face he's just radiating with  happiness  with all this carnage many chapters ago  debbie said to hawkes that he would be  the one to make stains will a reality  well yeah i doubt this is stains will  but whatever  going back to the main battlefield now  deku and bakugou have an interaction  that was totally different from what i  thought it was  so what happened was deku shoots off  away from back ago and towards shigaraki  and last week i thought you know this is  what the translation said  i thought bakugou was calling out to him  kind of you know telling him not to  sacrifice his life  going up against the demon that is  shigaraki but instead  the panel starts with bakago being left  in the dust you know not even knowing  what to say  and then when he does say something he  just curses in frustration  this makes it seem like he's more  concerned about being left behind by  deku in terms of their growth as a hero  as rivals you know they always want to  one-up each other but it seems that  bakago is now beginning to realize  that deku is just that little bit better  than him remember  nearly 10 chapters ago bakugou was  monologuing about how he isn't going to  be left behind  and how he can't afford to lose to deku  not to mention the fact that he took  issue with midoriya being the main  character as he called it  this just seems like he's taking issue  with deku surpassing him more than  anything else  but do let me know what you guys think  on this one is he concerned about deku  or is it a mixture of both is he both  concerned and also  upset that deku is overtaking him  another cool detail was related to  shigaraki  and if you've read the chapter you'll  know that his body finally began to  suffer some blowback  for using all of this power despite  being woken up at just 75  completion the moment when he suffers  the blowback from his quirk  it's a bit too gory for me to show right  now but let's just say his right arm is  hanging  like some kind of ripped teddy bear as  deku approaches  shiggy asks him what the date is which  is confirmation that this whole time  shiguraki didn't actually know he'd been  woken up early  i don't know about you guys i just  assumed he already knew because it's not  like the heroes were going to show up  coincidentally  on the exact day you were meant to come  out and also we got to remember that  shiguraki woke up on the ground instead  of inside his tank  that should have been a dead giveaway  but yeah for whatever reason  shiguraki never realized that he'd been  let out of the tank early  and so he was asking deku about the date  because he was trying to work out  you know am i at a hundred percent  probably not  undeniably though the best moment of  this chapter was deku activating his  third quark  which is known as float as most of you  know this was possessed by nana shimura  who was the seventh holder of one for  all  and one thing that was really clear in  the official chapter release  was exactly how he was using black whip  in tandem  with this new ability we can see that  he's floating in the air  and using his left arm to hold up the  heroes including ryukyu who is now back  into her human form  with her arm just being totally messed  up after shiguraki did some serious  damage  when she was in her dragon form one  thing you may not have noticed though  is that in deku's right arm he's using  black whip to yank shigaraki into the  sky  what this means is that perhaps the  decay that shigaraki was about to  unleash  well now that he's in the air maybe that  stopped which is good news for heroes  like mirko and president mike  who had literally no way of avoiding the  destruction if it was to come  also by pulling shigeraki with his right  hand he's kind of keeping the villains  separate from everyone else  some of you might have been surprised  that deku activated float  without talking to nana shimura in some  way but when i looked back at chapter  210 which is when black whip was first  introduced  it wasn't until two chapters later that  deku spoke to the fifth user of one for  all  in this situation i reckon it might be a  similar thing in that nana shamura  reaches out to him within a few chapters  we saw how the first user of one for all  was able to talk to deku  despite the fact that deku wasn't  sleeping he wasn't brainwashed or  anything like that so i reckon nana  shimura can do the same thing  the last thing to mention on this  chapter is that the name of the chapter  is 75  and while this refers to shigaraki it  does also refer to deku  and his use of both black whip and float  at the same time  as we know float was formally possessed  by the seventh user  and blackwhip was formally possessed by  the fifth user so  seven five you know 75 it has two  different meanings in this sense  one that refers to deku in his multiple  quirks and one that refers to shigaraki  and him coming out of the tank earlier  but with all that said those were the  details that you may have missed in  chapter 283  don't forget to sub and please like this  video and share it around if you liked  it  and don't forget that part 3 of my war  arc review should be out later this week  peace out

